<p style="margin:0;" id="appendix-d001-the-edge-of-the-map-aBody" class="accuracy-ledger-body">Your credences sum to 1, so the point sits on the line. No other credence is closer to the truth in <em>every</em> world. This is the bare demand of accuracy — the same conclusion as Day 1's Dutch book, reached without a single bet.</p>
